WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.916 --> 00:00:19.733
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:27.160
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.343
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.343 --> 00:00:34.568
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.568 --> 00:00:40.232
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.232 --> 00:00:45.720
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:51.464
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.464 --> 00:00:57.651
Every correction and every reset is written down automatically.

9
00:00:57.651 --> 00:01:05.018
At the foot of Records, tap View change log.

10
00:01:05.018 --> 00:01:11.545
Newest first: who, which day, and when it was changed.

11
00:01:11.545 --> 00:01:18.499
Nothing here can be edited or deleted — not even by an instructor.

12
00:01:18.499 --> 00:01:26.233
That is what makes the attendance record worth trusting.
